# Intentional public release files stay versioned: LICENSE, AGENTS.md, tests,
# wallets.txt, SHA256SUMS, detached .sig files and reviewed public trust keys.
# Git metadata is handled by Git itself; this file does not configure HTTP access.

# Exact filenames reserved for reviewed public release-verification keys.
!/release-public-key.pub
!/release-public-key.pem
!/release-public-key.asc
!/release-public-key.gpg

.agent-private/
.agent-secrets/
.internal/
config.local.toml
!config.local.toml.example
